WEBVTT

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:05.680
Everyone, make sure that when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:09.200
You're in a well-lit room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:23.970
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.860
A brand new world is starting right now
Ima hajimarunda

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:34.440
Even if there are painful things on my way
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:40.840
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:48.600
I'm starting to walk on a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:54.830
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:58.050
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:01.180
And there's no one who can stop it
darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:06.200
My heart is tightening and jumping all over the place
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:10.560
So start flapping your wings from now
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:13.610
and soar high to the sky up there
ano sora he to takaku

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:19.580
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.910
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:26.180
That's what I believed
sou shinjiteiru no

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:31.340
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:54.750
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:57.500
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:04.070
<i>In order to bring peace back to Deltora, I defeated evil monsters and recovered the topaz, ruby and opal!</i>

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:07.090
<i>Honestly... You're always just being reckless though.</i>

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:07.840
<i>Jasmine!</i>

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.040
<i>It's all thanks to me that you even got this far.</i>

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.600
<i>And don't forget about me either.</i>

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.500
<i>Barda!</i>

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:15.600
<i>Filli! Kree!</i>

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:20.200
<i>We are in the middle of our journey to search for the seven gems!</i>

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.700
<i>And right now, we're on our way to the
Shifting Sands where the fourth gem is hidden!</i>

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:42.300
I never imagined that the three of us would survive the preliminaries.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:47.100
Yeah. It's one thing if it's you, Barda, but to think that me and Jasmine made it too...

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:50.680
What's wrong, Jasmine?

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:52.400
Are you angry?

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.330
Because of what I said just now?

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:55.700
That's not it.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:57.800
We need to talk.

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:06.940
With this, we've raked in 300 gold coins if we combine all of our earnings, right?

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.300
Yeah.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:10.940
We're all set for money for a while.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:12.320
It was a great success!

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:16.060
Then there's no real need to risk our lives here any further, right?

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:21.290
Even if you say that, we're not allowed to withdraw from the main tournament, you know?

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:21.980
Yeah.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:28.370
And what I'm saying is, why can't we just perform poorly in the future fights and lose intentionally?

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:32.600
So you mean like fixing the match? I wouldn't do something like that.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:35.030
I can't do that either.

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:40.400
What are you guys talking about? We've more than satisfied our reasons for coming here by now!

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:44.580
I know that, but that's far from fair play for the other contestants.

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:47.000
Fair play...?

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.250
You're talking about fair play?!

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:53.400
Since when has 'fair play' been a theme of this tournament?!

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:55.580
There's also the guy who attack us last night.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:58.560
You mean Doom?

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:02.210
I still can't say for sure whether or not it was Doom, but...

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:06.420
That's just going to please the culprit, who tried to confine us so we couldn't participate.

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:11.300
Try to remember why we've even travelled out here! The pair of you!

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:15.440
It'll all be for naught if we get hurt for the sake of your worthless pride!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.140
However...

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:19.480
Barda...!

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:36.000
So he's spying on us, huh...

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:39.500
So, do you still think that it's better for us lose?

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.880
Because I don't want to lose. No matter what.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:50.440
Whatever, this is getting us nowhere.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:56.990
I understand where Jasmine is coming from, but...

00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:58.070
Yeah.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:03.720
Congratulations for making it into the main tournament, everyone!

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:08.400
Do feel free to eat your fill and rest your body up for the night!

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:11.900
So good!!

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:18.020
Still, even though this dining hall was pretty crowded with the tournament's contestants last night...

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:23.520
It's gotten pretty lonely now, hasn't it?

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:25.720
They all went home, probably.

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:30.900
They must be dreading the journey back home...

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:37.160
Mother Brightly! Bring me more cider!!

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:41.030
Right away! But you guys sure are strong, aren't you?

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:45.500
It sure was a sight when Glock and Orwen threw their opponents away like nothing.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:50.200
And how Birdie and Neridah moved so quick that their opponents couldn't even get close to them!

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:56.410
And then there's Twig! You didn't strike me as such a masterful swordsman with your appearance!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.910
You really impressed me!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:05.300
Jas-... Uhh, I mean, Birdie, what's wrong?

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:07.860
I'm just not hungry.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:11.500
Could it be that you're still angry about before?

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.210
That has nothing to do with this.

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:17.510
Then, at least try to drink this cider.

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:20.300
You'll be able to get some strength back if you drink it.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:21.910
Don't need it.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.640
Could I have your attention please?

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:33.000
From tonight onward, I will personally hold onto your room keys and will lock your rooms for you.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.870
What's the meaning of this?

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:38.480
It's nothing; just a precaution to avoid any further incidents.

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:44.580
Don't worry, I will unlock them all myself at the very first bell in the morning.

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:49.200
With this, we don't have to worry getting locked up again.

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:53.400
Tomorrow's main tournament is the true highlight of this game.

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:58.320
I'm sure that the spectators' excitement will be utterly feverish!

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:02.720
And if there were a contestant who didn't give their all in such a situation...

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:13.420
The spectators would not forgive it.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:20.960
I'm afraid that they will go so far as to head down to the ring
themselves and mercilessly attack those who lose on purpose.

00:07:23.610 --> 00:07:26.810
For example, whether you're spouses...

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.980
Or if you're good friends...

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:33.720
They won't forgive you if you don't give them a good fight.

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:37.200
So please remember that.

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:45.800
Yeah yeah, I can see that my plan won't work here after all.

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:50.400
I'm more scared of the spectators than our opponents now...

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:54.740
Hey hey, what are you getting all gloomy for?

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:58.500
You're all going to lose to me either way.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:03.750
So rather than worrying about the spectators, be afraid of this guy right here!

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:14.200
Come! Drink some more! Eat some more!

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:17.330
Enjoy this last supper of yours!

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:21.880
In my case though, it's an early victory feast!

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:24.200
You've had too much cider.

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:27.430
You'd better head off to bed soon.

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:28.710
What did you say?!

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:35.580
That boasting of yours, about how <i>you're</i>  going to win this is proof enough that you've already had too much to drink.

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.440
Go to bed already, little boy.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.620
Don't you test me!!

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:41.520
Stop that!

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:47.530
All of you still have important fights tomorrow.

00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:51.770
I won't allow you to injure yourselves outside of the Games!

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:14.400
I just can't stay still when I think about the fight tomorrow.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:16.710
Neridah...

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.310
Hey, Twig...

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:24.110
Twig?

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:26.200
You mean me?

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.700
Are you not afraid?

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:31.620
Afraid...?

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:35.200
I am a little.

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:38.030
After all, I was only winning because I was getting lucky.

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:40.000
That had nothing to do with luck!

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:42.580
You were really strong back there!

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:44.380
Nah, not really...

00:09:47.510 --> 00:09:49.620
The one who got lucky was me...

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:51.640
Neridah...

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:59.770
I did everything I could to enter the Rithmere Games for my poor mother and sister, but...

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:03.500
I don't think my good luck will carry me any further...

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:08.610
But, at very least you'll still return home with 100 gold coins, right?

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:12.410
If possible, I want to go home right away...

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:16.480
But, I wasn't allowed to do that!

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:20.630
Just how am I supposed to win against those big guys anyway?!

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:22.760
Neridah...

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:23.800
Oh right!

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:27.500
You seem like a good person, so please help me!

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:32.320
I want you to send my gold coins to my mother if something happens to me!

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:35.980
You mustn't think like that.

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:40.190
Please! You're the only one I can rely right now!

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:42.360
Neridah, you should deliver them yourse-...

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:43.600
Thank you so much!

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:45.900
You're so kind, Twig!

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:50.270
I am so happy!

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:55.560
Then, see you tomorrow!

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:02.830
Twig, please return to your room now.

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:06.620
Twig!

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:15.170
Lief? What are you grinning like an idiot for?

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:18.000
O-Oh, it's nothing.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:23.810
If we have to face each other tomorrow, I want you guys to fight seriously.

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:27.240
What?! Are you serious?!

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:30.100
Yeah. I am.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:35.580
Back when I was still a guard at Del Palace, my comrades always said...

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:38.700
That I have to spar seriously if I don't want to get hurt.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:40.460
But...

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:44.550
It's not like we'll try to kill each other. It's just a bit of sport.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.500
I see.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:51.300
So it's like a foot race, right? You'll be more likely to fall and injure yourself if you don't run seriously.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:55.650
Will it really be safer this way...?

00:11:56.380 --> 00:12:00.320
And if it's a foot race, no matter who my opponent is, I will still give it my all.

00:12:00.890 --> 00:12:03.580
So no hard feelings over whoever wins tomorrow, okay?

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:04.300
Yeah...

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.300
Good. Then let's get some sleep.

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:09.510
Good night.

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:10.920
Good night...

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:13.300
Good night.

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:29.560
Come and get your Queen Bee Cider!

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:35.000
Listen here! The one who showed his absolute strength was no other than Glock the Jalis!

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:38.080
We're accepting bets right here!!

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:42.780
Neridah! Show more of your cute side to us!!

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:47.900
This is the greatest!

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:49.800
And here are the fighters!

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:13.440
Now, we're going to decide the pairings for the main tournament with this lottery!

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:18.400
Fighters, come forward and pick your ropes!

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:26.770
Has everyone decided on their ropes?!

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:28.200
Are you ready?!

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:30.440
Well then!

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:48.800
First match,

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.800
Berry vs Doom!

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:54.700
Right off the bat, huh...

00:13:57.620 --> 00:13:59.400
Second match,

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.500
Joanna vs Glock!

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:05.230
Far too weak.

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:10.480
I can't wait to beat that overconfidence out of you!

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.160
Third match,

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:15.800
Twig vs Neridah!

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:24.390
Fourth match, Birdie vs Orwen!

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:26.890
This will be an easy fight.

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:29.620
Don't look down on me.

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:34.300
Oh my! What wonderful pairings!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:39.240
Now, hurry up! Hurry up and start the fight already!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.300
So it's time...

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:50.510
Yeah...

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:55.700
First match, Berry vs Doom!

00:14:56.400 --> 00:14:57.640
Let the match begin!

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:58.630
Here I go.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:14:59.840
Come.

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:20.680
Berry!

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:38.300
Doom...

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:42.710
Are you really sure you have the time to be participating in these games?

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:45.890
Don't you have more important business elsewhere?

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:50.600
And what of yourselves? Have you forgotten your mission?

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:54.950
Mr. 'Berry from Bushtown'?

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:58.880
You...!!

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:08.790
Think about it. Even if you lose here, you can still continue your journey without injury.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:24.340
Berry has fallen from the ring!

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:27.200
The winner is Doom!

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:29.630
Berry!

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:31.720
Berry! Are you alright?!

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.200
Shit...!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:36.700
Even though he's the only one that I didn't want to lose to...!

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:42.600
That man... He knew that I used a false name to register.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.340
What does this mean?!

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:47.390
I don't know,

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:50.900
But there's one thing that's clear to me now.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:59.000
He's definitely no average man.

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:01.500
Oh dear...

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:04.700
I really thought that 'Berry' was his real name, too...

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:08.800
But that was amazing! Such a manly duel!

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:10.490
Bravo!!

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:12.300
Second match,

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:15.800
Glock vs Joanna!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:24.300
You sure are slow.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.620
Hey Joanna...

00:17:29.550 --> 00:17:32.720
You won't win this fight if you keep running away, you know?

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:37.820
Now, here I come!!

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:55.200
Hey, just now...

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:58.200
Did you hit me with something...?

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:03.920
Nothing to say now, Madam?

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:04.990
Take that!

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:08.080
Joanna!

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.590
Get her, Glock!

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:09.860
That's it! Keep going!
Get her, Glock!

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:11.830
That's it! Keep going!

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:14.900
Let her go, Glock! You've already won this match!!

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:21.980
Joanna has lost consciousness!

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:24.380
The winner is Glock!

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:30.590
So exciting! So fantastic!

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:32.460
Are you alright, Joanna?!
So exciting! So fantastic!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:33.400
Are you alright, Joanna?!

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:35.440
However...

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:40.750
I'd probably enjoy it more if someone with more elegance were the victor.

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:45.420
Next is your match, Lief.

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:46.790
Yeah.

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:56.380
Third match, Neridah vs Twig!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.280
Let the match begin!

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:17.420
Lie-... I mean, Twig!!

00:19:17.780 --> 00:19:19.200
What's wrong, Twig?

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:22.480
Twig...

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:29.990
I just can't fight against you...

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:35.460
Neither can I... I can't bring myself to hurt you...

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:38.240
Twig...

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:40.340
Neridah...

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:43.600
Avoid this, Twig!

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:54.790
Neridah...! Are you throwing the match for my sake...?!

00:19:56.160 --> 00:19:57.200
It's okay...

00:19:58.570 --> 00:19:59.610
This way, I...

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:04.540
NERIDAH!!

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:16.280
Twig, behind you!!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:21.770
No, she's on your left!

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:25.950
No, not there! Your right, right!!

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:26.760
But no one's here...

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:28.500
Below you, Twig!!

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:31.010
You idiot, she's behind you!

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:33.150
Your left!

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:34.620
Below you!

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:36.070
Now she's above!

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:37.920
Below you!!

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:46.360
Bye bye, Twig.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:01.780
Cheers...?

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:03.990
Where am I...?

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:08.140
Oh right, the match!

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:12.490
So you've finally come around.

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:13.180
Barda...

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:15.240
What about the match?

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:16.220
It's over now.

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:19.580
But then, what about all this cheering?

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:23.700
